  "updated_at": "2026-03-04",
  "bio": "Alexandra Tattooing is renowned for her exceptional skill level in crafting ornamental, floral, and uniquely vegan tattoo designs. Operating out of the pristine DG-Studio in Markkleeberg, Germany, clients can expect a fusion of intricate geometry and natural beauty, meticulously inked to perfection. With a portfolio that speaks to her artistic mastery, Alexandra is a go-to tattoo artisan for those seeking a touch of elegance and sophistication in their body art.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Markkleeberg, Saxony, Germany"
}